      "summary": "Raw learner answers/transcripts and incomplete PII redaction make direct Session 3/Tutor snapshot persistence unsafe."
    },
    {
      "id": "R1-B05",
      "classification": "BLOCKER",
      "summary": "The full Tutor-to-Study evidence/result adapter and queue/calendar/parent enforcement persistence hooks are not implemented."
    },
